{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764780/extras/mff-logo-for-homepage-v2-x3.png?t=1753637720\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Monkey Fruit Fight! brings competitive shooter mechanics to a colorful 2D world. Jump, dodge, aim, and fire in lightning-fast 1v1 battles that feel like arena FPS shooters meets retro arcade gaming! Dominate friends and strangers alike to the beat of a pumping synthwave soundtrack!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764780/extras/a0d687d9beeaf0e63d049235e4525a5c.poster.avif?t=1753637720\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764780/extras/a0d687d9beeaf0e63d049235e4525a5c.webm?t=1753637720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764780/extras/a0d687d9beeaf0e63d049235e4525a5c.mp4?t=1753637720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u26a1 INSTANT ARCADE COMBAT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three clicks and you're dueling!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast matches (best of 5 rounds, max 100 seconds)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect for quick gaming sessions anywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All ages - competitive fun without violence!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf4c CHOOSE YOUR FRUIT LOADOUT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick 3 weapons from your arsenal:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Banana, Watermelon, Pineapple, Pumpkin, Coconut, Carambola</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each weapon has different firing patterns and damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Like choosing your loadout in an FPS - but fruity!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfaf PRECISION PLATFORMER COMBAT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump, dodge, and navigate colorful arenas with unique features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aim with precision - every shot counts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Movement and positioning matter as much as aim</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge players on Android devices too - cross-platform duels!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f PURE RETRO ARCADE VIBES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pixel-perfect 80s/90s arcade aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original synthwave soundtrack pumps up the action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40 character skins inspired by retro culture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colorful arenas from tropical beaches to space stations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udca5 COMPETITIVE BUT ACCESSIBLE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy to learn - hard to master platformer mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Family-friendly combat that's genuinely competitive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick to jump in, endless skill ceiling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge friends or find opponents worldwide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple server regions for great ping - because ping matters!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle in colorful arenas where every match feels like an intense arcade showdown - but with the strategic depth of modern competitive gaming!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>